raph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025220/extras/5a26f8d44a7e85c29d4257d8d98d2415.poster.avif?t=1754190726\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025220/extras/5a26f8d44a7e85c29d4257d8d98d2415.webm?t=1754190726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025220/extras/5a26f8d44a7e85c29d4257d8d98d2415.mp4?t=1754190726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025220/extras/2017c74ed2071164dc8a3c401fffd073.poster.avif?t=1754190726\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025220/extras/2017c74ed2071164dc8a3c401fffd073.webm?t=1754190726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025220/extras/2017c74ed2071164dc8a3c401fffd073.mp4?t=1754190726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game  Announcement:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The  game  will  be  updated  periodically  or  have  certain  level  contents  revised.  We  welcome  any  feedback  and  reviews  you  may  have.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
